[{"answer":"Good morning. What can I do for you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/1.mp3"},{"answer":"I want to report a theft.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/2.mp3"},{"answer":"I had some things stolen out of my bag yesterday.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/3.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm sorry to hear that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Right, so I'll need to take a few details.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Can I start with your name?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Louise Taylor.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/7.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, thank you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/8.mp3"},{"answer":"And are you resident in the UK?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/9.mp3"},{"answer":"No, I'm actually Canadian. Though my mother was British.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/10.mp3"},{"answer":"And your date of birth?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/11.mp3"},{"answer":"December 14th, 1977.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/12.mp3"},{"answer":"So you're just visiting this country?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/13.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/14.mp3"},{"answer":"I come over most summers on business.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/15.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm an interior designer and I come over to buy old furniture, antiques you know.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/16.mp3"},{"answer":"There are some really lovely things around here,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/17.mp3"},{"answer":"but you need to get out to the small towns.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/18.mp3"},{"answer":"I've had a really good trip this year, until this happened.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/19.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/20.mp3"},{"answer":"So you've been here quite a while?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I'm here for two months.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/22.mp3"},{"answer":"I go back next week.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/23.mp3"},{"answer":"So may I ask where you're staying now?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/24.mp3"},{"answer":"Well at present I've got a place at Park Apartments, that's on King Street.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/25.mp3"},{"answer":"I was staying at the Riverside Apartments on the same street,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/26.mp3"},{"answer":"but the apartment there was only available for six weeks","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/27.mp3"},{"answer":"so I had to find another one.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/28.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/29.mp3"},{"answer":"And the apartment number?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/30.mp3"},{"answer":"Fifteen.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/31.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/32.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, I need to take some details of the theft.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/33.mp3"},{"answer":"So you said you had some things stolen out of your bag?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/34.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/35.mp3"},{"answer":"And were you actually carrying the bag when the theft took place?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/36.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I really can't understand it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/37.mp3"},{"answer":"I had my backpack on.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/38.mp3"},{"answer":"And I went into a supermarket to buy a few things","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/39.mp3"},{"answer":"and when I opened it up my wallet wasn't there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/40.mp3"},{"answer":"And what did your wallet have in it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/41.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, fortunately I don't keep my credit cards in that wallet,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/42.mp3"},{"answer":"I keep them with my passport in an inside compartment in my backpack.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/43.mp3"},{"answer":"But there was quite a bit of cash there...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/44.mp3"},{"answer":"about £250 sterling, I should think.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/45.mp3"},{"answer":"I withdrew £300 from my account yesterday,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/46.mp3"},{"answer":"but I did a bit of shopping,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/47.mp3"},{"answer":"so I must have already spent about £50 of that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/48.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/49.mp3"},{"answer":"At first I thought, oh I must have left the wallet back in the apartment,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/50.mp3"},{"answer":"but then I realised my phone had gone as well.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/51.mp3"},{"answer":"It was only a week old,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/52.mp3"},{"answer":"and that's when I realised I'd been robbed.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/53.mp3"},{"answer":"Anyway at least they didn't take the keys to my rental car.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/54.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/55.mp3"},{"answer":"So you say the theft occurred yesterday?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/56.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/57.mp3"},{"answer":"So that was September the tenth.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/58.mp3"},{"answer":"And do you have any idea at all of where or when the things might possibly have been stolen?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/59.mp3"},{"answer":"Well at first I couldn't believe it because the bag had been on my back ever since I left the apartment after lunch.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/60.mp3"},{"answer":"It's just a small backpack,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/61.mp3"},{"answer":"but I generally use it when I'm travelling because it seems safer than a handbag.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/62.mp3"},{"answer":"Anyway, I met up with a friend,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/63.mp3"},{"answer":"and we spent a couple of hours in the museum.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/64.mp3"},{"answer":"But I do remember that as we were leaving there, at about 4 o'clock,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/65.mp3"},{"answer":"a group of young boys ran up to us,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/66.mp3"},{"answer":"and they were really crowding round us,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/67.mp3"},{"answer":"and they were asking us what time it was,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/68.mp3"},{"answer":"then all of a sudden they ran off.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/69.mp3"},{"answer":"Can you remember anything about them?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/70.mp3"},{"answer":"The one who did most of the talking was wearing a T-shirt with a picture of something...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/71.mp3"},{"answer":"let's see... a tiger.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/72.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/73.mp3"},{"answer":"Any idea of how old he might have been?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/74.mp3"},{"answer":"Around twelve years old?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/75.mp3"},{"answer":"And can you remember anything else about his appearance?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/76.mp3"},{"answer":"Not much.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/77.mp3"},{"answer":"He was quite thin...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/78.mp3"},{"answer":"Colour of hair?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/79.mp3"},{"answer":"I do remember that - he was blond.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/80.mp3"},{"answer":"All the others were dark-haired.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/81.mp3"},{"answer":"And any details of the others?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/82.mp3"},{"answer":"Not really.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/83.mp3"},{"answer":"They came and went so quickly.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/84.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/85.mp3"},{"answer":"So what I'm going to do now is give you a crime reference number so you can contact your insurance company.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/86.mp3"},{"answer":"So this is ten digits:","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/87.mp3"},{"answer":"8795482361.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/88.mp3"},{"answer":"Thank you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/89.mp3"},{"answer":"So should I contact...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-1-section-1-2023-01-24-23-55-53/90.mp3"}]
